ta": null, "removed": true, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": null}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[135.168, 33.59999901199341], [244.608, 33.59999901199341], [244.608, 44.399998694419864], [135.168, 44.399998694419864]], "bbox": [135.168, 33.59999901199341, 244.608, 44.399998694419864]}, "block_description": "The header of a section of text or other blocks.", "block_type": "21", "block_id": 2, "page_id": 1, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": true, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "heading_level": 2, "html": "<h2>INTRODUCTION</h2>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[47.616, 74.99999779462814], [333.312, 74.99999779462814], [333.312, 549.5999838390351], [47.616, 549.5999838390351]], "bbox": [47.616, 74.99999779462814, 333.312, 549.5999838390351]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 3, "page_id": 1, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": "<p>Ok, This is the moment when I connect with you as an ordinary human being, before revealing my hidden face. Many of you know me as a young woman full of dreams, but my soul is ancient. My higher self has guided my journey in a magical, nostalgic, and mystical way since childhood \u2014 like a subtle voice calling my attention to the trees, the flowers, the mountains, the stars, the sea, and the river. As an extremely creative child, I spent my days drawing, painting, and writing stories about magical beings and places: winged horses, angels, demons, mermaids, fairies, and enchanted forests \u2014 to dissociate from the pain and trauma caused by the reflections of society's structure, which deeply affected my family and continues to affect the lives of many people. As a teenager who never quite fit in, expressing myself in an eccentric and spontaneous way, refusing to follow patterns, I always listened to that inner voice. When I stopped to gaze at the ocean alone, the horizon seemed to speak to me like an old friend. And I always carried the strange feeling that I had already lived</p>"}], "excluded_block_types": ["1", "2"], "maximum_assignment_distance": 20, "refs": [], "ocr_errors_detected": false, "pdftext_page": null, "current_children": [{"polygon": {"polygon": [[135.168, 33.59999901199341], [244.608, 33.59999901199341], [244.608, 44.399998694419864], [135.168, 44.399998694419864]], "bbox": [135.168, 33.59999901199341, 244.608, 44.399998694419864]}, "block_description": "The header of a section of text or other blocks.", "block_type": "21", "block_id": 2, "page_id": 1, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": true, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "lowres_image": null, "highres_image": null, "removed": false}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[47.616, 74.99999779462814], [333.312, 74.99999779462814], [333.312, 549.5999838390351], [47.616, 549.5999838390351]], "bbox": [47.616, 74.99999779462814, 333.312, 549.5999838390351]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 3, "page_id": 1, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "lowres_image": null, "highres_image": null, "removed": false}]}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[0.0, 7.9200005531311035], [384.0, 7.9200005531311035], [384.0, 607.9199829101562], [0.0, 607.9199829101562]], "bbox": [0.0, 7.9200005531311035, 384.0, 607.9199829101562]}, "block_description": "A single page in the document.", "block_type": "8", "block_id": 1, "page_id": 2, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [{"page_id": 2, "block_id": 1, "block_type": "23"}], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "children": [{"polygon": {"polygon": [[44.56700134277344, 27.946542871775538], [336.83365631103516, 27.946542871775538], [336.83365631103516, 563.2785936663083], [44.56700134277344, 563.2785936663083]], "bbox": [44.56700134277344, 27.946542871775538, 336.83365631103516, 563.2785936663083]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 0, "page_id": 2, "text_extraction_method": null, "structure": null, "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": {"23": 0.9782912731170654}, "layout_token_count": 0, "metadata": null, "removed": true, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": null}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[44.160000000000004, 30.599999100208283], [336.384, 30.599999100208283], [336.384, 561.5999834861756], [44.160000000000004, 561.5999834861756]], "bbox": [44.160000000000004, 30.599999100208283, 336.384, 561.5999834861756]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 1, "page_id": 2, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": "<p>many experiences throughout the universe, for it was very difficult to follow the evangelical Christian religion under which I had been indoctrinated by my family. The idea of having lived other lives was obvious and undeniable within me, which created challenges with my relatives. Therefore, I left home at the age of eighteen and began my own theosophical, philosophical, scientific, ufological, and conspiratorial studies, seeking to discover the reason for existence on my own, always questioning the purpose behind each experience. I found in Eastern philosophies, in meditation and contemplation, and in the precepts of Taoism, a way to access the true meaning of life. Thus began my spiritual journey, which led me to further inexplicable experiences with consciousness, opening portals within my mind through which I could access fragmented glimpses of how it all began in the primordial void. The intense connection with this Creative Source, with the spirits of nature, the orix\u00e1s, the elementals, the winged horses, dragons, and mermaids accompanies me in dreams and visionary journeys. My soul pulses with joy when I realize that the Great Mother Earth communicates with me, sees me, reads me</p>"}], "excluded_block_types": ["1", "2"], "maximum_assignment_distance": 20, "refs": [], "ocr_errors_detected": false, "pdftext_page": null, "current_children": [{"polygon": {"polygon": [[44.160000000000004, 30.599999100208283], [336.384, 30.599999100208283], [336.384, 561.5999834861756], [44.160000000000004, 561.5999834861756]], "bbox": [44.160000000000004, 30.599999100208283, 336.384, 561.5999834861756]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 1, "page_id": 2, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "lowres_image": null, "highres_image": null, "removed": false}]}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[0.0, 7.9200005531311035], [384.0, 7.9200005531311035], [384.0, 607.9199829101562], [0.0, 607.9199829101562]], "bbox": [0.0, 7.9200005531311035, 384.0, 607.9199829101562]}, "block_description": "A single page in the document.", "block_type": "8", "block_id": 3, "page_id": 3, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [{"page_id": 3, "block_id": 2, "block_type": "23"}, {"page_id": 3, "block_id": 3, "block_type": "20"}], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "children": [{"polygon": {"polygon": [[40.134544372558594, 36.96078477895333], [341.41577911376953, 36.96078477895333], [341.41577911376953, 497.0287482022729], [40.134544372558594, 497.0287482022729]], "bbox": [40.134544372558594, 36.96078477895333, 341.41577911376953, 497.0287482022729]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 0, "page_id": 3, "text_extraction_method": null, "structure": null, "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": {"23": 0.9879873991012573}, "layout_token_count": 0, "metadata": null, "removed": true, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": null}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[158.1500810623169, 513.2610292191039], [224.96028957366943, 513.2610292191039], [224.96028957366943, 577.5806135094299], [158.1500810623169, 577.5806135094299]], "bbox": [158.1500810623169, 513.2610292191039, 224.96028957366943, 577.5806135094299]}, "block_description": "An image block that represents a picture.", "block_type": "20", "block_id": 1, "page_id": 3, "text_extraction_method": null, "structure": null, "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": {"20": 0.9440237283706665}, "layout_token_count": 0, "metadata": null, "removed": true, "description": null, "html": null}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[39.552, 37.79999888849259], [340.608, 37.79999888849259], [340.608, 495.5999854269028], [39.552, 495.5999854269028]], "bbox": [39.552, 37.79999888849259, 340.608, 495.5999854269028]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 2, "page_id": 3, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": "<p>and protects me. Therefore, I feel drawn to the Nordic and Celtic religions \u2014 the pagan roots that gave birth to Druidism, Wicca, and natural witchcraft \u2014 for I have learned that to connect with nature is to connect with the energy of this primordial Creative Source. This book I bring to you is the result of nine years spent searching for truth and for the true God, whom I found only within my own consciousness. Always confirming the insights revealed to me by my higher self through the philosophies, stories, studies, and scientific experiments found in our physical world, and by interlinking all of them, I arrived at many conclusions about how existence truly works. I have \u201clost my innocence\u201d in the sense that I no longer hold a childlike or romanticized view of gods, angels, and ascended masters, understanding that the beginning of existence predates all stories we know and is far more complex and expansive than our human mind can ever envision. Our size and importance in the face of all that may exist are less than insignificant. Yet, that does not mean it isn\u2019t incredibly fascinating and fun.</p>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[160.512, 513.5999848976136], [221.18399999999997, 513.5999848976136], [221.18399999999997, 573.5999831333161], [160.512, 573.5999831333161]], "bbox": [160.512, 513.5999848976136, 221.18399999999997, 573.5999831333161]}, "block_description": "An image block that represents a picture.", "block_type": "20", "block_id": 3, "page_id": 3, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "description": null, "html": null}], "excluded_block_types": ["1", "2"], "maximum_assignment_distance": 20, "refs": [], "ocr_errors_detected": false, "pdftext_page": null, "current_children": [{"polygon": {"polygon": [[39.552, 37.79999888849259], [340.608, 37.79999888849259], [340.608, 495.5999854269028], [39.552, 495.5999854269028]], "bbox": [39.552, 37.79999888849259, 340.608, 495.5999854269028]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 2, "page_id": 3, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "lowres_image": null, "highres_image": null, "removed": false}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[160.512, 513.5999848976136], [221.18399999999997, 513.5999848976136], [221.18399999999997, 573.5999831333161], [160.512, 573.5999831333161]], "bbox": [160.512, 513.5999848976136, 221.18399999999997, 573.5999831333161]}, "block_description": "An image block that represents a picture.", "block_type": "20", "block_id": 3, "page_id": 3, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "lowres_image": null, "highres_image": null, "removed": false}]}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[0.0, 7.9200005531311035], [384.0, 7.9200005531311035], [384.0, 607.9199829101562], [0.0, 607.9199829101562]], "bbox": [0.0, 7.9200005531311035, 384.0, 607.9199829101562]}, "block_description": "A single page in the document.", "block_type": "8", "block_id": 3, "page_id": 4, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [{"page_id": 4, "block_id": 2, "block_type": "23"}, {"page_id": 4, "block_id": 3, "block_type": "20"}], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "children": [{"polygon": {