lse, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": "<p>The image of the violet black hole, which I use to represent the Source Matrix that communicates with me \u2014 the consciousness of the void beyond all forms \u2014 is the closest way to describe how I perceive the vibration of the primordial being from which all existence arises. And this Source asks for a chance from the players of this simulation to hear its voice within themselves, to open their own portals, to remember, and to reconnect. Be activated, for this being dwells within you and shall be in you forever.</p>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[40.32, 263.39999225473406], [340.224, 263.39999225473406], [340.224, 332.99999020814903], [40.32, 332.99999020814903]], "bbox": [40.32, 263.39999225473406, 340.224, 332.99999020814903]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 5, "page_id": 5, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": "<p>\u201cThe Spirit of truth, whom the world cannot receive, because it neither sees Him nor knows Him; but you know Him, for He dwells with you and will be in you forever.\u201d</p>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[45.312, 356.39998952007295], [155.904, 356.39998952007295], [155.904, 368.39998916721345], [45.312, 368.39998916721345]], "bbox": [45.312, 356.39998952007295, 155.904, 368.39998916721345]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 6, "page_id": 5, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockqu